# linux-flatpak-releases

Releases **Flatpak** publiques pour les apps Linux Mr-Aurevo-X listées ici (pas de sources).  
**Crypto Tracker** sur ce hub. **Hub Système** et **UtilKit** : releases sur leurs dépôts publics ([Gest_Linux_Pro](https://github.com/Mr-Aurevo-X/Hub-Systeme), [UtilKit](https://github.com/Mr-Aurevo-X/UtilKit)).

Canal natif (zips / tar.gz) : https://github.com/Mr-Aurevo-X/linux-releases

| App | Dernier tag | Paquet |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Crypto Tracker** | [`crypto-tracker-v@CT_VERSION@`](https://github.com/Mr-Aurevo-X/linux-flatpak-releases/releases/tag/crypto-tracker-v@CT_VERSION@) | `org.mraurevox.CryptoTracker.flatpak` |

## Crypto Tracker @CT_VERSION@

```bash
curl -fL -o org.mraurevox.CryptoTracker.flatpak \
  https://github.com/Mr-Aurevo-X/linux-flatpak-releases/releases/download/crypto-tracker-v@CT_VERSION@/org.mraurevox.CryptoTracker.flatpak
flatpak install --user -y ./org.mraurevox.CryptoTracker.flatpak
flatpak run org.mraurevox.CryptoTracker
```

Prérequis : [Flatpak](https://flatpak.org/setup/) + Flathub + runtime Freedesktop 25.08.  
Données : `~/.local/share/crypto-tracker/`

